OL,3,GNEWSAWoman to be reunited with
OL,4,A'much-loved' dog's ashes which lay in
OL,5,Alost property for months
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) recently
OL,8,Fissued an appeal for the owner -
OL,9,Ffearing that the urn contained human
OL,10,Fremains.
OL,12,FOfficers said the woman had now
OL,13,Fcontacted them - clarifying the urn
OL,14,Fcontained the remains of her family
OL,15,Fpet. They are making arrangements to
OL,16,Freturn the urn and the teddy - which
OL,17,Fthe woman has owned since childhood.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
